<section id="S7.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">7.3 </span>Additional Scores Histograms</h3>

<div id="S7.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section are provided additional examples similar to Figure <a href="#S5.F3" title="Figure 3 ‣ 5 Results ‣ SAEmnesia: Erasing Concepts in Diffusion Models with Sparse Autoencoders" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>, to further demonstrate the robustness of our methods throughout different concepts, such as Architectures <a href="#S7.F7" title="Figure 7 ‣ 7.3 Additional Scores Histograms ‣ 7 Appendix ‣ SAEmnesia: Erasing Concepts in Diffusion Models with Sparse Autoencoders" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>, Rabbits <a href="#S7.F8" title="Figure 8 ‣ 7.3 Additional Scores Histograms ‣ 7 Appendix ‣ SAEmnesia: Erasing Concepts in Diffusion Models with Sparse Autoencoders" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a> and Sea <a href="#S7.F9" title="Figure 9 ‣ 7.3 Additional Scores Histograms ‣ 7 Appendix ‣ SAEmnesia: Erasing Concepts in Diffusion Models with Sparse Autoencoders" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>. For all the objects, we have a clear transition from a distributed histogram with high entropy, to a well defined peaked latent score.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S7.F7" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2509.21379v1/architectures_saeur_scores.svg" id="S7.F7.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:329/158;" width="329" height="158"></object></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2509.21379v1/architectures_saemnesia_scores.svg" id="S7.F7.g2" class="ltx_graphics ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:329/158;" width="329" height="158"></object></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S7.F7.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 7</span>: </span><span id="S7.F7.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Feature importance score distributions for <em id="S7.F7.6.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Architectures</em> concept. (Left) Model pre-trained unsupervised showing dispersed concept scores. (Right) After <span id="S7.F7.6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">SAEmnesia</span>-OC-FT supervised finetuning showing a clear dominant peak.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="S7.F8" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2509.21379v1/rabbits_saeur_scores.svg" id="S7.F8.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:329/158;" width="329" height="158"></object></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2509.21379v1/rabbits_saemnesia_scores.svg" id="S7.F8.g2" class="ltx_graphics ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:329/158;" width="329" height="158"></object></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S7.F8.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 8</span>: </span><span id="S7.F8.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Feature importance score distributions for <em id="S7.F8.6.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Rabbits</em> concept. (Left) Model pre-trained unsupervised showing dispersed concept scores. (Right) After <span id="S7.F8.6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">SAEmnesia</span>-OC-FT supervised finetuning showing a clear dominant peak.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="S7.F9" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2509.21379v1/sea_saeur_scores.svg" id="S7.F9.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:329/158;" width="329" height="158"></object></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2509.21379v1/sea_saemnesia_scores.svg" id="S7.F9.g2" class="ltx_graphics ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:329/158;" width="329" height="158"></object></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S7.F9.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 9</span>: </span><span id="S7.F9.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Feature importance score distributions for <em id="S7.F9.6.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Sea</em> concept. (Left) Model pre-trained unsupervised showing dispersed concept scores. (Right) After <span id="S7.F9.6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">SAEmnesia</span>-OC-FT supervised finetuning showing a clear dominant peak.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="S7.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">7.4 </span>Additional unlearning visualization</h3>

<div id="S7.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figures <a href="#S7.F10" title="Figure 10 ‣ 7.4 Additional unlearning visualization ‣ 7 Appendix ‣ SAEmnesia: Erasing Concepts in Diffusion Models with Sparse Autoencoders" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a> and Figures <a href="#S7.F11" title="Figure 11 ‣ 7.4 Additional unlearning visualization ‣ 7 Appendix ‣ SAEmnesia: Erasing Concepts in Diffusion Models with Sparse Autoencoders" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a> provides additional visualization when unlearning with <span id="S7.SS4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">SAEmnesia</span>.</p>
</div>
