<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S7.F10.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 10</span>: </span><span id="S7.F10.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Qualitative examples of concept removal with <span id="S7.F10.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">SAEmnesia</span>. Each row shows a different style, and each column a different object concept.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="S7.F11" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.21379v1/grid_seed188_p2_20x20.png" id="S7.F11.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:685/685;" width="685" height="685" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S7.F11.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 11</span>: </span><span id="S7.F11.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Qualitative examples of concept removal with <span id="S7.F11.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">SAEmnesia</span>. Each row shows a different style, and each column a different object concept.</span></figcaption>
